<p data-structure="Conclusion" id="p_132">
</p><p data-structure="Precedent" id="p_133">94.   We may also note that in terms of what has been opined in




<span class="hidden_text" id="span_98">                                                             Page 69 of 84</span>
Gujarat Urja Vikas Nigam Ltd.39 (GJ-I), such adjudication of disputes

